    {
      "text": "This article lists the ranges and limitations for policies, fields, and other features of Zscaler SDK for Mobile Apps (ZSDK). All values are per organization unless noted otherwise."
    },
    {
      "text": "If you need to increase the maximum limit for your organization, send a request to Zscaler Support."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Administration",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "The following table shows the ranges and limitations for administration settings:"
    },
    {
      "table": [
        [
          "Feature",
          "Limit"
        ],
        [
          "Admins",
          "1,000 admins"
        ],
        [
          "Roles",
          "100 roles"
        ]
      ],
      "strong": [
        [
